                                "sense_id": "a21cc07a-b6ef-36fc-ad2d-e73096811c25",
                                "text": "To shelter quivering natures, wrap them round / In downy softness, and impalace them / Mid fair magnificence, where all is found / Abundant as the longing heart can wish."
